name umtypewriter
category Package
revision 64443
shortdesc Fonts to typeset with the xgreek package
longdesc The UMTypewriter font family is a monospaced font family that
longdesc was built from glyphs from the CB Greek fonts, the CyrTUG
longdesc Cyrillic alphabet fonts ("LH"), and the standard Computer
longdesc Modern font family. It contains four OpenType fonts which are
longdesc required for use of the xgreek package for XeLaTeX.
